  "limitations": [
    "Only PyTorch 2.15.0+cpu, CPython 3.12.14 with the GIL/main interpreter, little-endian Linux x86_64 and RV64 SimX are qualified. This is simulated inference evidence, not processor RTL, AFU/vendor hw_emu, physical FPGA, silicon or physical performance.",
    "The supported matmul set is FP16/BF16 crossed with (M,N,K)=(8,4,8),(8,4,16),(16,8,16), with FP32 output. Model scope is the frozen synthetic bias-free batch-16 16-to-8-to-4 ReLU MLP, five families per format and two destination poisons; arbitrary model loading and trained-model quality are outside scope.",
    "CPU tensor storage, packing, exact conversion, ReLU and row assembly are declared host work. Native matmul dispatch and actual result lineage are checked; no CPU matmul fallback qualifies. Host timing/profile categories overlap and establish no physical speedup or additive device latency.",
    "Autograd/training, a full framework device backend, CUDA binary compatibility, ONNX, multiple devices, real fork execution and unsupported platform/version combinations are unqualified. Higher-level linearize, input-free FX constant evaluation and scripted invocation can submit native work and are not covered by a universal rejection claim.",
    "Independent host review reconciles 45 unique scripted definitions and nine compiled scenarios per original; these repeat across formats/revisions. Missing capture arrays and intermediate failure/ownership channels prevent complete host-assertion reconstruction. Synthetic or fixture host arithmetic is not native numerical evidence.",
    "Per original, 82 retained first-party source paths and 731 additional receipt-only first-party paths match the execution Git revision. Receipt matches do not rehash absent historical files; 193 submodule paths lack the same byte comparison. Third-party wheel/payload, interpreter/tool/seed and some generated metadata bytes are absent.",
    "Trusted hosted builder observations, source joins and inert replay establish bounded retained consistency, not arbitrary-producer authentication, reproducible compilation or complete offline binary qualification. Original ZIPs are retained unchanged outside Git with owner-authenticated access; public availability after provider expiry is not established.",
    "The public reader performs no native execution and never grants acceptance. All native_execution, retained_code_executed, acceptance_claimed, phase_acceptance and host_fault_semantics_revalidated fields preserve their documented non-execution/false values; this separate review record makes the acceptance decision.",
    "The c6 primary matrix and c0 historical matrix remain different execution populations. At one revision the pair contains 32 framework calls, 72 framework-route launches and 216 total distinct launches; copies and repeated reviews add zero launches.",
    "Final host validation is the bounded 547-test P05 suite. Earlier local broad governance failed at the 1 GiB host-fixture reserve; d8 hosted governance passed with 23 skip events representing 36 unexecuted bodies. Neither supplies the P06 single full zero-skip invocation. Cancelled/pending workflows are not passes.",
    "P01-A03 vendor integration, P06-A02/A03 and their resource/performance/RTL gates remain open. The native/P06 15 GiB reserve and inherited 267-to-283 DSP area finding against the unchanged 5 percent bound are not waived. No goldens, arithmetic fixtures, thresholds or native ABI changed."
  ],
